      "content": "the professional stuff doesnt change the reality tho. the reality is i'm just a drain on her energy and her money and her life. she spends all her time making sure im okay and i just feel like im stealing her future so she can babysit me. it honestly feels selfish to keep dragging this out when i know how much it's costing her.",
